/T (Karunisai was held on Saturday, December 14th, at the Kirkland Performing Arts Center  from 2:00 PM to 4:00 PM and 6:00 PM and 8:00 PM. Tickets were sold for $20 and  children under 10 were granted free attendance. We chose to hold two productions  on the same day to maximize ticket sales while minimzing venue costs and set-up times. )
