491 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (After Karunisai, the next step of the project was completing a wire transfer of the $24,718  from the Temple of Music to the Chankanai Divisional Hospital. We coordinated with Sathiyamootthy Thangamuthu, director of the hospital, to confirm that the funds were received. He informed us that the hospital purchased 150 stationary bicycles and 100 parallel bars, which the administration estimates will benefit over 150 patients annually. We also sent our curated therapeutic recordings of the Carnatic pieces to complement physical therapy sessions.)
/E (After Karunisai, the next step of the project was completing a wire transfer of the $24,718  from the Temple of Music to the Chankanai Divisional Hospital. We coordinated with Sathiyamootthy Thangamuthu, director of the hospital, to confirm that the funds were received. He informed us that the hospital purchased 150 stationary bicycles and 100 parallel bars, which the administration estimates will benefit over 150 patients annually. We also sent our curated therapeutic recordings of the Carnatic pieces to complement physical therapy sessions.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [25]
>>
