/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (With the help of Sathiyamootthy Thangamuthu, we identified a bipolar patient who  consented to have her progress tracked in a one month long case study through her  musopathy journey. Each week, we focused on a different raga \(scale\) known for its therapeutic properties. It was consistently observed by hospital personnel that the patient exhibited significant improvements in her emotional regulation, focus, and engagement in rehabilitation activities.)
/E (With the help of Sathiyamootthy Thangamuthu, we identified a bipolar patient who  consented to have her progress tracked in a one month long case study through her  musopathy journey. Each week, we focused on a different raga \(scale\) known for its therapeutic properties. It was consistently observed by hospital personnel that the patient exhibited significant improvements in her emotional regulation, focus, and engagement in rehabilitation activities.)
