568 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This project aimed to raise funds for the Chankanai community to supply physiotherapy equipment to a local hospital, addressing the needs of individuals with musculoskeletal dystrophy and helping prevent further life-threatening injuries in rural Sri Lankan communities. To achieve this, we partnered with the Temple of Music in Redmond, WA, organizing performances focused on classical South Asian music styles, particularly Carnatic music.  Alongside the new physiotherapy equipment we aimed to fund, our goal was to offer our audience a unique cultural experience while also helping hospitals incorporate Carnatic music as a neurotherapeutic tool, due to its scientifically proven calming and therapeutic effects.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
