/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The primary goal of our project is to harness the power of Carnatic violin to raise funds for acquiring physical therapy equipment for the Chankanai Rehabilitation Hospital in Sri Lanka. We also are aiming to provide emotional and psychological support through recordings of Carnatic music. The lack of adequate physical therapy equipment in many Sri Lankan hospitals hinders patient recovery, and by raising funds, we aim to purchase devices that will enhance rehabilitation services. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
