760 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Description: We held Karunisai on Saturday, December 14th at the Kirkland Performing Arts Center. There were two performances to maximize profits: one from 2:00 PM to 4:00 PM and one from 6:00 PM to 8:00 PM. Holding them on the same day helped to minimize costs with venue rental. We sold tickets for $20 and offer free attendance for children ten and under. Before the performances begin, we invited Ganesh Rajagopalan to speak about the cause of inadequate access to healthcare in Sri Lanka, especially relating to physical therapy. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
