/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/T (To ensure the success of the Karunisai project, we implemented a structured quality management plan focusing on three key areas: event preparation and execution, financial oversight, and post-event evaluation. These areas were carefully chosen to address the critical elements required for delivering a smooth, impactful, and transparent project. We followed the quality management cycle of first defining standards, implementing checks, measuring results, monitoring, and addressing issues. This helped ensure our project operated smoothly. Each area involved clear objectives, actionable steps, and regular reviews to make sure that the project remained on track and met its goals.)
