1014 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Saanvi was in charge of advertising the Karunisai event and finding and setting up the ticket-selling platform. She designed the flyers shown to the right. She distributed them to Hindu temples and Tamil schools around the greater Seattle area to attract the South Asian community and local businesses willing to promote the event. She also realized that digital advertising would be effective, as it could better target South Asian people who may be interested in this cultural event and allow for easier spreading of the event information. She sent out digital copies  of the flyer on platforms such as Facebook and WhatsApp to attract  family audiences of South Asians and others who may be interested  in learning more about its culture.)
/E (Saanvi was in charge of advertising the Karunisai event and finding and setting up the ticket-selling platform. She designed the flyers shown to the right. She distributed them to Hindu temples and Tamil schools around the greater Seattle area to attract the South Asian community and local businesses willing to promote the event. She also realized that digital advertising would be effective, as it could better target South Asian people who may be interested in this cultural event and allow for easier spreading of the event information. She sent out digital copies  of the flyer on platforms such as Facebook and WhatsApp to attract  family audiences of South Asians and others who may be interested  in learning more about its culture.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [0]
>>
