endobj
1034 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (The Karunisai events were held on Saturday, December 14th at the Kirkland Performing Arts Center. We held two events, one from 2:00 PM to 4:00 PM and one from 6:00 PM to 8:00 PM, so we could maximize ticket sales. By holding the events on the same day, we minimized the time we spent using the venue and therefore reduced the costs associated. The performers arrived at 12:00 PM for sound check and final rehearsals while volunteers helped to decorate and set up a ticket booth for same day ticket sales. They also plastered informational posters about our cause around the venue with links to donate directly. Before each performance, we invited Ganesh Rajagopalan to speak about the cause highlight the importance of physical health to Sri Lankans, helping us acheive our secondary goal of raising awareness. The performance consisted of 10 Carnatic pieces composed by Ganesh Rajagopalan, including ballads that pay respect to the plight of the Sri Lankan Tamil community. )
/E (The Karunisai events were held on Saturday, December 14th at the Kirkland Performing Arts Center. We held two events, one from 2:00 PM to 4:00 PM and one from 6:00 PM to 8:00 PM, so we could maximize ticket sales. By holding the events on the same day, we minimized the time we spent using the venue and therefore reduced the costs associated. The performers arrived at 12:00 PM for sound check and final rehearsals while volunteers helped to decorate and set up a ticket booth for same day ticket sales. They also plastered informational posters about our cause around the venue with links to donate directly. Before each performance, we invited Ganesh Rajagopalan to speak about the cause highlight the importance of physical health to Sri Lankans, helping us acheive our secondary goal of raising awareness. The performance consisted of 10 Carnatic pieces composed by Ganesh Rajagopalan, including ballads that pay respect to the plight of the Sri Lankan Tamil community. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
1035 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Between the two events, we welcomed 602 guests total, out of which 585 were paying guests, 249 in the first showing and 336 in the second showing, raising $11,700 through ticket sales and $659 through direct donations for a total amount of $12,359. We then met with a Temple of Music member who was a Microsoft Employee. They helped us double our contribution to the Hospital by applying for corporate matching through the Microsoft Matching Gifts program, for a total amount of $24,718.)
/E (Between the two events, we welcomed 602 guests total, out of which 585 were paying guests, 249 in the first showing and 336 in the second showing, raising $11,700 through ticket sales and $659 through direct donations for a total amount of $12,359. We then met with a Temple of Music member who was a Microsoft Employee. They helped us double our contribution to the Hospital by applying for corporate matching through the Microsoft Matching Gifts program, for a total amount of $24,718.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
