1054 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Case Study: After donating the funds, we wanted to ensure that the therapeutic Carnatic music recordings we provided were truly making a difference. With the help of Chankanai Division Hospital director Dr. Thangamuthu and patient consent, we identified a 21-year-old woman at the hospital diagnosed with bipolar disorder who agreed to participate in a month-long case study to assess the impact of the music on her mental health and overall well-being.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
