1269 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Karunisai project effectively used WhatsApp and Facebook to attract its core South Asian audience, but future projects should broaden their reach by leveraging platforms like Instagram and YouTube. Instagram reels and stories could highlight performances or behind-the-scenes moments, while YouTube can host project highlights and patient impact stories. These channels, paired with targeted ads, can attract younger demographics and non-South Asian audiences who may resonate with the mission. Expanding social media outreach will boost visibility, ticket sales, and overall support for the project.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
