1275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Future projects should focus on tracking the long-term effects of their contributions. Metrics like the number of patients treated or improvements in recovery rates can highlight the success of donated equipment and music therapy. Sharing these outcomes through impact reports or social media updates can inspire continued support and attract new donors. Success stories, such as patients benefiting from the physiotherapy tools or Carnatic music therapy, can further demonstrate the tangible benefits of the project while building trust with stakeholders.)
/Pg 28 0 R
/K [7]
>>
